        <Param val="You will now complete a colour-word task for 30 minutes.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Important: choose the colour of the letters, ignoring the word:&amp;#10;&amp;#10;left = red&amp;#10;down = green&amp;#10;right = blue&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Every 10 minutes, the task will pause and you will be asked to rate how MENTALLY FATIGUED you feel. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Full instructions for the rating scale will appear the first time it comes up.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Press SPACE to begin the experiment.  " valType="str" updates="constant" name="text"/>
